="point",text="Re-run the loader and make sure your executor is up to date. Still nothing? Open a ticket in our Discord with a screenshot of the F9 console.",opts={{"Join Discord","join"},{"Back","help"}}},h_feat={text="Toggle it off and on again and check its settings. Still broken? Send a short video in our Discord and we'll fix it fast.",opts={{"Join Discord","join"},{"Back","help"}}},h_fps={text="Turn off the heavy stuff: Shaders, Texture Pack, Weather and ESP glow. Your FPS will thank you.",opts={{"Back","help"},{"Bye",false}}},h_other={gesture="point",text="Open a ticket in our Discord. Real people answer there, not trolls. Mostly.",opts={{"Join Discord","join"},{"Back","help"}}},news={gesture="cheer",text="Pulse Hub was rebuilt almost from scratch: new menu, new aim, new ESP and a pile of new features. Pick a topic!",opts={{"Aim & combat","n_aim"},{"ESP & visuals","n_vis"},{"Skins & effects","n_skins"},{"Menu & community","n_social"},{"Farm, mobile & more","n_more"},{"Back","start"}}},n_aim={gesture="point",text="New Pulse X aim: predicts movement, beats speed and desync cheaters and waits for a clean shot near walls. Shot Timing, Sticky Target, knife throw aim and Auto Throw. Backtrack shows where the server really sees players. Plus Anti Aim with desync modes, Anti Coin, a Fling panel and Pick Up Gun from any distance.",opts={{"Next","n_vis"},{"Topics","news"},{"Bye",false}}},n_vis={text="ESP rebuilt from zero: boxes, skeleton, chams, names, fonts and presets with previews, plus ghosts of desync cheaters. Shader packs with HD materials, Texture Pack, custom skies and sky effects, weather, bullet and knife tracers, custom cursors and kill effects with sounds. Screen stretch now keeps every label in place.",opts={{"Next","n_skins"},{"Topics","news"},{"Bye",false}}},n_skins={gesture="cheer",text="Weapon Skin Changer with its own Changer page in your inventory and Pulse rarity skins. Avatar skins, free animation bundles, emotes and combos that load without lag. Auras, hats, walk trails, self and tool chams. Everyone with Pulse sees your skins and effects too.",opts={{"Next","n_social"},{"Topics","news"},{"Bye",false}}},n_social={text="The new Nova menu: themes, glass, sizes, keybind list and floating cards. Pulse Chat with replies and reactions, Pulse Users to jump into other Pulse players' servers, Config Hub to share configs, owner and admin tags, map vote boost, a music player, game sounds and victory music.",opts={{"Next","n_more"},{"Topics","news"},{"Bye",false}}},n_more={gesture="point",text="Auto Farm with Coin and Role modes: wins, murderer kills and EXP. On phones: on-screen buttons in three styles, Double Tap Lock, Fly, Bhop, NoClip, Speed and more, plus safe two-finger dragging. New fly and walk speed methods, Wall Hop, better invisibility, an optimizer, an FPS and ping widget, and Russian and Ukrainian.",opts={{"Next","n_end"},{"Topics","news"},{"Bye",false}}},n_end={gesture="laugh",text="That's the big stuff! Small fixes and every next update land in our Discord first. Problem?",opts={{"Join Discord","join"},{"Topics","news"},{"Bye",false}}},who={gesture="laugh",text="Just a troll who lives next to the radio. I watch sheriffs miss and murderers fail all day. Problem?",opts={{"Back","start"},{"Bye",false}}}}ec.Trolly.ugotLyrics={{endsAt=2.35,words={{0.7,"Cause"},{1.1,"you"},{1.26,"got"},{1.58,"that"}}},{endsAt=3.9,words={{2.54,"Cause"},{3.1,"you"},{3.22,"got"},{3.52,"that"}}},{endsAt=6.6,words={{4.02,"I"},{4.12,"like"},{4.56,"you"},{5,"cause"},{5.3,"you"},{5.48,"got"},{6.06,"that"}}},{endsAt=8.05,words={{6.75,"Something"},{7.06,"better"},{7.32,"than"},{7.7,"me"}}},{endsAt=10.6,words={{8.1,"If"},{8.26,"I"},{8.58,"like"},{8.92,"you,"},{9.22,"give"},{9.62,"it"},{9.94,"to"},{10.16,"me"}}},{endsAt=11.9,words={{10.66,"Cause"},{10.9,"you"},{11,"got"},{11.24,"that"}}},{endsAt=14.3,words={{12.02,"I"},{12.12,"like"},{12.38,"you"},{12.76,"cause"},{13.04,"you"},{13.3,"got"},{13.82,"that"}}},{endsAt=15.6,words={{14.4,"Some